<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups in Cabo Delgado have released fishermen they were holding captive, ending a recent hostage situation. Chapo has called for cooperation to protect Africa’s strategic minerals, linking mineral security to the conflict zone. The insurgency continues with Islamist militants targeting civilians and clashing with Mozambican security forces. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premier Christian News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPYTk5bWtTUHlOTlJfZm1KTmVwbGptOUllM1pHc2pyY3lOT3VDOE1CUHpTMnZCeW03UFFSak9LTkNwTGxlTjZNMVNfSG9HU1B2S1VVQ1Y2Xy0tT1ItSGxqcDVmajlUa2NqZzJKT0Vpd3FXaE1VUC16dDBLLW5aSU9QZlpIcFJ0c1RRMG1LWTFiaWxBc053dDg3WTJPVFl0MjVaT1Vjc1c3eTZHSUd0TFpxNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPNFh5enlIQmNIRmRjN2xmZTBGemZQVkRFRnVTNWFKV1FwakNOS3oxTW0waFo4bXVCa01ScFdSc2VjN1BTaGdDOWdTbHJJdVh6OFlnZG1FMi15YVB5emhfLTBsaUVDSUZvOEZPclVrTDVLZzJFYU5lT1lINllyN1hMTHhtTlh4TGFwa1JYekpEM0pKX0ZWU0xFTzhqV2dSQjdQQkpkTjFSOHFHRXNJdzJ0SldvQVdVUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Maverick&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQVUFSNFBDc2x4X0xZWVhqNlZ0b2ZZQjdZSjV1LVZvRE9oTXRWWDcxZldGS2pNaHFUbEtRWW9tZmhrdDBldmdSUkg1OG1OZ1BFWllYUmVZV1pxTkUyaEVINnhTdmpIVC1uNjF4aTlPNHh2Ui1nbndFN29NejhGbS0taXhXY0ZyRFlTbkp3OG1LdnRJU2VhUndGUVhqNWw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE1PNkN3SURTR29aX1JmR21SakFLc1hrYllxUmxpYTVsNGJuTlJ1Vm15UlJSdy1mZFVOaTM5eTVjU2xOYkxCdmlIVWZocjNBM1hCbWFFeksyWXJ6SXBKRW82T3AtcjRIeHo1bWw1cGtqZDZyR1pX?oc=5&quot;&gt;Herald.co.zw&lt;/